{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Of the following \n</p><p>(1) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/1/c01fc7d94e4bbb0fe440df5a1ad3ef323cbe7663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x-y)=ax-ay$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>(2) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/8/6a8a9e4a21f715902c5a63edb648536f06a899c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{x-y}=a^x-a^y$\" width=\"116\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>(3) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/1/bf10ab6d0372cd8933fefbc5ce98ea2c628e2263.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log (x-y)=\\log x-\\log y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"198\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>(4) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/c/5ccf9755ab65b256635baa8a56d03a4fb598dd7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log x}{\\log y}=\\log{x}-\\log{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"160\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>(5) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/a/0fa4cfa719c81078a8e1ede8349a3a20c24f7854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(xy)=ax \\cdot ay$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/b/66b832f485d34f05352dc9e400dffecca4f57522.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\text{Only 1 and 4 are true}\\qquad\\\\\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{Only 1 and 5 are true}\\qquad\\\\\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{Only 1 and 3 are true}\\qquad\\\\\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{Only 1 and 2 are true}\\qquad\\\\\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{Only 1 is true}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"98\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The distributive property doesn't apply to logarithms or in the ways illustrated, and only applies to addition and subtraction. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd5300cd7a2b33b575e8b535ccdbc78f4093ed78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{x-y} = \\frac{a^x}{a^y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"79\" height=\"36\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/395ae1d00fe0750ebc6f9f5c5d0e32239d4a460c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} \\text{ Only 1 is true}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"145\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;